<title>USA: PETsMART stake held by Vulcan group.</title>
<headline>PETsMART stake held by Vulcan group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Vulcan Ventures Inc said Friday it holds a 5.20 percent stake in PETsMART Inc or 5,484,548 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Vulcan said its latest transactions include the purchase of 10,000 common shares on October 28 at a price of $27.125 per share.</p>
<p>Vulcan bought the stake for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
<p>PETsMART, of Phoenix, Ariz., is a pet supply retailer</p>
